    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Milwaukee River flows through Waubeka and provided a vital power source for the community's early industries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waubeka%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Waubeka is located within the Southeastern Wisconsin glacial till plains created during the most recent ice age.",
